  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "7182101",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Hongyu",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "718210101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "718210101": {
            "id": "718210101",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Hongyu",
            "text": "How did I end up doing this...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718210102"
            ]
          },
          "718210102": {
            "id": "718210102",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "What's wrong?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718210103"
            ]
          },
          "718210103": {
            "id": "718210103",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Hongyu",
            "text": "Xiao Lanterns don't just vanish into thin air after each Lantern Rite, you know? They have to be recovered manually.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718210104"
            ]
          },
          "718210104": {
            "id": "718210104",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Hongyu",
            "text": "Sure, they are quite a view, floating majestically in the air, but at the same time, they can also be quite a nuisance.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718210105"
            ]
          },
          "718210105": {
            "id": "718210105",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Hongyu",
            "text": "If its lampshade is poorly made, a lantern will break mid-air, leaving only a chunk of Plaustrite that flies all over the place.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718210106"
            ]
          },
          "718210106": {
            "id": "718210106",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Hongyu",
            "text": "Some Xiao Lanterns also get blown away by the wind and end up stuck in random nooks...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718210107"
            ]
          },
          "718210107": {
            "id": "718210107",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Hongyu",
            "text": "The former creates safety concerns, while the latter litters the city landscape. So the Ministry of Civil Affairs usually delegates the responsibility of recovering Xiao Lanterns to a specific person.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718210108"
            ]
          },
          "718210108": {
            "id": "718210108",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Hongyu",
            "text": "As it happens, it's my turn this year...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718210109"
            ]
          },
          "718210109": {
            "id": "718210109",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Hongyu",
            "text": "But the amount of Xiao Lanterns released during the festival is overwhelming... If I were to retrieve them all the day after the celebrations end, I'd be done for.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718210110"
            ]
          },
          "718210110": {
            "id": "718210110",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Hongyu",
            "text": "So the only feasible way is to remove the broken and misplaced lanterns gradually, as people release them.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718210111"
            ]
          },
          "718210111": {
            "id": "718210111",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Hongyu",
            "text": "Even so, I doubt I can collect them all on my own.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718210112"
            ]
          },
          "718210112": {
            "id": "718210112",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Hongyu",
            "text": "Traveler, would you mind checking a few spots for Xiao Lanterns that need to be recovered?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718210113"
            ]
          },
          "718210113": {
            "id": "718210113",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Leave it to me.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718210114"
            ]
          },
          "718210114": {
            "id": "718210114",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Hongyu",
            "text": "I've marked the locations on the map for you. Thanks for your help!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7182102",
      "subQuestName": "Head to the designated location to collect the Xiao Lantern",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "718210201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "718210201": {
            "id": "718210201",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Flash-Fist Ling",
            "text": "That's not fair!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718210202"
            ]
          },
          "718210202": {
            "id": "718210202",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "What are you doing here?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718210203"
            ]
          },
          "718210203": {
            "id": "718210203",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Flash-Fist Ling",
            "text": "I... Ugh, let me start from the beginning. My master recently developed a new kicking technique. An immensely powerful one at that!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718210204"
            ]
          },
          "718210204": {
            "id": "718210204",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Flash-Fist Ling",
            "text": "But he claimed that I wasn't earnest enough, and that I still needed to work on the basics. He wouldn't teach me the new technique...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718210205"
            ]
          },
          "718210205": {
            "id": "718210205",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Flash-Fist Ling",
            "text": "I planned to take advantage of the Lantern Rite and give him a nice Xiao Lantern to soften his attitude. Perhaps a change of mood would lead to a change of heart, and he'd agree to teach me those moves, or so I thought.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718210206"
            ]
          },
          "718210206": {
            "id": "718210206",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Flash-Fist Ling",
            "text": "But I couldn't find any Plaustrite, so when I noticed that a Xiao Lantern got stuck over there, I wanted to retrieve the Plaustrite inside...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718210207"
            ]
          },
          "718210207": {
            "id": "718210207",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Flash-Fist Ling",
            "text": "You saw what happened next... Eh, I don't deserve that Xiao Lantern. You can have it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718210208"
            ]
          },
          "718210208": {
            "id": "718210208",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Flash-Fist Ling",
            "text": "Encountering those monsters really made me realize that my martial arts foundations leave a lot to be desired..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7182103",
      "subQuestName": "Collect the Xiao Lantern",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "718210301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "718210301": {
            "id": "718210301",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Hongyu",
            "text": "Have you checked all the spots I marked for you yet? Any Xiao Lanterns recovered?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718210302"
            ]
          },
          "718210302": {
            "id": "718210302",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Three Xiao Lanterns altogether.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718210303"
            ]
          },
          "718210303": {
            "id": "718210303",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Hongyu",
            "text": "Thanks so much. It would have been a lot of work to retrieve the Xiao Lanterns in those places. The trip tires me right out each time...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718210304"
            ]
          },
          "718210304": {
            "id": "718210304",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Hongyu",
            "text": "With your help, I can finally rest easy. So please, take this for your trouble. You've more than earned it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7182104",
      "subQuestName": "Head to the designated location to collect the Xiao Lantern",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "718210401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "718210401": {
            "id": "718210401",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Hongyu",
            "text": "They release them, I take them back, and so on and so forth. Am I the only one who sees no point in this?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7182105",
      "subQuestName": "Collect the Xiao Lantern",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "718210501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "718210501": {
            "id": "718210501",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Flash-Fist Ling",
            "text": "It's all because I'm too weak. I have a long way to go to fully grasp my master's teachings."
          }
        }
      }
    },
